title: "The Sharp Four-Thirds Width Ratio for Exact Gaussian Discretization on Rectangular Lattices"
authors:
  - given-names: Yongxian
    family-names: Zhang
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-3864-3536"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mxym/math"
abstract: "The optimal asymptotic ratio of squared widths is 4/3 for exact Gaussian conversion on fixed rectangular lattices. All fixed lattices satisfy the necessity; the skew-lattice sufficiency and additive threshold remain open."
